values ('c4d5e6f7-8a9b-4c74-9d15-2e3f4a5b6c74', 'integrated-marketing-communications', 'Integrated Marketing Communications', 'Integrated Marketing Communications teaches students how to design coordinated, measurable, and ethically responsible campaigns across advertising, public relations, digital, social, direct, experiential, sponsorship, retail, and owned media. Students learn to move from business problem to customer insight, positioning, creative brief, media plan, budget, execution workflow, and performance dashboard. The course is built around professional campaign practice: every communication choice must have a strategic reason, a defined audience, a clear message role, and a measurable learning plan.');

